                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.003/425: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-09-23T12:00:00-04:00">September 23,
                        1930—noon</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>328. Your 834, September 20, 9 p.m. Please telegraph text or substance of any
                    changes of importance.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
